WEBVTT

01:13.000 --> 01:18.320
[Meet Yourself]

01:20.000 --> 01:24.320
[Episode 39]

01:25.684 --> 01:27.564
The village council is right here!
[Meeting room]

01:28.154 --> 01:30.314
You could always come here and consult.

01:32.154 --> 01:32.964
What did you do?

01:32.964 --> 01:34.683
You picked a time
when we went out to have a meeting

01:34.684 --> 01:36.193
and Hongdou's boyfriend was away.

01:36.194 --> 01:38.153
You made trouble at the construction site.

01:38.154 --> 01:40.594
What on earth do you want?

01:41.194 --> 01:42.244
We didn't make trouble.

01:42.244 --> 01:44.314
We just...

01:44.524 --> 01:46.843
want to hear the truth from her.

01:46.844 --> 01:47.994
What kind of truth?

01:47.994 --> 01:49.433
You could talk to the council.

01:49.434 --> 01:52.114
Instead, you chose to bully a girl.

01:52.524 --> 01:54.204
Shame on you!

01:55.404 --> 01:57.073
Think about your daughter.

01:57.074 --> 01:59.004
What if someone did this to her?

01:59.484 --> 02:00.763
And you!

02:00.764 --> 02:02.273
Why don't you just take my position?

02:02.274 --> 02:03.364
That way, you can take whatever presents

02:03.364 --> 02:04.474
Xie Zhiyao sends.

02:05.084 --> 02:06.714
I was out of my mind.

02:06.714 --> 02:08.683
I didn't mean it.

02:08.684 --> 02:11.004
That's rumormonger! Do you hear me?

02:11.474 --> 02:13.794
We've explained to
you so many times

02:13.994 --> 02:15.684
why we don't support your start-up.

02:15.964 --> 02:17.684
Did you even hear?

02:17.924 --> 02:18.754
You're running a guesthouse

02:18.754 --> 02:20.243
using your residence illegally!

02:20.244 --> 02:22.433
You didn't even get a business license!

02:22.434 --> 02:23.803
If you insist on running it,

02:23.804 --> 02:27.074
any risk of safety
disaster is beyond you!

02:28.644 --> 02:29.434
How is it possible

02:29.434 --> 02:30.963
for us to provide a loan guarantee?

02:30.964 --> 02:32.754
It's the council that decides this!

02:33.084 --> 02:35.284
What is Xie Zhiyao? He has no saying at all!

02:36.644 --> 02:38.194
Calm down.

02:41.524 --> 02:42.034
Listen up.

02:42.034 --> 02:44.123
Delete the video clip on your phone.

02:44.124 --> 02:45.644
If it spreads out,

02:45.644 --> 02:48.643
no one will ever do business with our village.

02:48.644 --> 02:49.844
Over the years,

02:49.844 --> 02:51.754
Xie Zhiyao works so hard for our village.

02:51.754 --> 02:52.474
He contributed a lot of money

02:52.474 --> 02:53.754
to the road and the bridge construction.

02:53.754 --> 02:55.873
You know it perfectly!

02:55.874 --> 02:57.914
He's got commendations for this.

02:58.154 --> 03:00.243
If he really wants to monopolize,

03:00.244 --> 03:03.083
he'd take the investment abruptly.

03:03.084 --> 03:05.124
But that's not what he wants!

03:05.594 --> 03:07.523
Stop praising him.

03:07.524 --> 03:09.444
No one would give up his interest.

03:09.964 --> 03:12.153
It's not about praising him.

03:12.154 --> 03:13.994
According to the potential investor,

03:13.994 --> 03:14.994
the village will go through

03:14.994 --> 03:16.473
comprehensive commercial development.

03:16.474 --> 03:19.844
That way, our village
will be a replica antique.

03:19.844 --> 03:20.754
It would be torture

03:20.754 --> 03:21.923
to live in a place like that.

03:21.924 --> 03:22.994
In the end,

03:22.994 --> 03:24.803
we'll be flooded with retailers and tourists.

03:24.804 --> 03:28.404
Our advantage of
pristineness would be gone.

03:30.754 --> 03:31.874
What's more,

03:32.154 --> 03:34.684
recite the words from the meeting yesterday
to their faces.

03:35.874 --> 03:37.083
The town government said

03:37.084 --> 03:38.713
we can only develop tourism

03:38.714 --> 03:40.914
on condition of the three protections.

03:41.204 --> 03:42.363
To protect the environment,

03:42.364 --> 03:43.713
the cultural features,

03:43.714 --> 03:45.873
and the living quality of the residents.

03:45.874 --> 03:47.404
We must avoid developing disorderly

03:47.404 --> 03:48.593
in pursuit of profits.

03:48.594 --> 03:51.083
We must follow the idea
of sustainable development.

03:51.084 --> 03:52.524
Whoever the investor is,

03:52.524 --> 03:53.524
whoever it is starting a business,

03:53.524 --> 03:54.924
they must follow these principles.

03:54.924 --> 03:57.153
We can only approve reasonable requests.

03:57.154 --> 03:59.273
It applies to everyone
with no exception at all.

03:59.274 --> 04:00.714
Look at the guestrooms we have.

04:00.714 --> 04:02.963
They all signed leases with us,

04:02.964 --> 04:04.843
for example, agreements for general sanitation

04:04.844 --> 04:06.124
and no disturbing.

04:06.124 --> 04:07.753
Apart from these files,

04:07.754 --> 04:09.874
there are other verbal agreements.

04:12.764 --> 04:13.964
Do you understand?

04:16.354 --> 04:17.764
I don't.

04:19.204 --> 04:20.434
It's all right.

04:20.884 --> 04:23.564
I've recorded what we just said.

04:23.564 --> 04:24.914
I'll send you a copy.

04:25.204 --> 04:27.714
And I'll transfer it to
everyone who showed up

04:27.714 --> 04:29.153
at the construction site.

04:29.154 --> 04:29.914
Listen to it repeatedly.

04:29.914 --> 04:31.524
You'll get it sooner or later.

04:31.914 --> 04:35.003
All in all, just like
what Director said,

04:35.004 --> 04:36.554
apologize to Hongdou.

04:37.154 --> 04:39.284
What you have done
is not decent at all!

04:40.114 --> 04:41.114
But,

04:41.234 --> 04:42.793
look at my arm. They beat me.

04:42.794 --> 04:44.164
It's inflamed.

04:44.404 --> 04:45.434
And here.

04:45.714 --> 04:47.884
Shouldn't they apologize to us?

04:47.884 --> 04:49.084
Right!

04:49.564 --> 04:54.003
You were causing troubles
and ruined their gate.

04:54.004 --> 04:55.524
Their measures are justifiable defenses.

04:55.524 --> 04:57.884
If they called the
police, you'd be detained.

04:58.714 --> 04:59.914
Anything else?

05:01.844 --> 05:03.764
Think about an apology.

05:04.964 --> 05:06.523
What were you thinking?

05:06.524 --> 05:07.524
Dismissed.

05:16.474 --> 05:17.474
Hello?

05:18.114 --> 05:20.284
We will need 250 more bricks.

05:20.794 --> 05:22.474
Is there enough in stock?

05:23.004 --> 05:24.354
When can you deliver them?

05:25.204 --> 05:25.713
Okay.

05:25.714 --> 05:27.524
Please get the product number right.

05:28.274 --> 05:29.204
Thank you.

05:29.204 --> 05:30.204
Grandpa Yang.

05:30.594 --> 05:31.523
Grandpa.

05:31.524 --> 05:32.524
Grandpa.

05:33.084 --> 05:34.403
How dare you!

05:34.404 --> 05:35.844
How dare you show up here?

05:38.004 --> 05:40.034
We're here to apologize!

05:42.114 --> 05:44.353
I'll... I'll beat you up!

05:44.354 --> 05:46.084
This is your lesson.

05:57.404 --> 05:58.404
Granny Yang.

05:58.564 --> 05:59.764
Where's Granny?

06:00.204 --> 06:01.844
She left with Hongdou.

06:04.404 --> 06:05.404
Okay. Thanks.

06:05.404 --> 06:06.404
No problem.

06:11.154 --> 06:12.004
This morning,

06:12.004 --> 06:13.884
it was weird when I saw Grandpa Yang

06:14.084 --> 06:15.473
showed up.

06:15.474 --> 06:17.434
I thought he was
there to make trouble.

06:18.354 --> 06:20.644
He sat there all day
except for lunchtime

06:20.644 --> 06:21.713
when he went away briefly.

06:21.714 --> 06:23.273
He went back soon after that.

06:23.274 --> 06:24.274
But he didn't say a word.

06:24.274 --> 06:26.914
I made him some
tea and he took it.

06:28.004 --> 06:30.643
Once those men showed
up, can you imagine?

06:30.644 --> 06:33.594
Grandpa Yang rushed
out with his crane.

06:35.444 --> 06:36.914
He's free.

06:37.154 --> 06:41.234
That's why I asked
him to keep guard.

06:42.884 --> 06:44.673
Thank you, Granny.

06:44.674 --> 06:46.474
I can always count on you!

06:47.354 --> 06:48.153
You bet!

06:48.154 --> 06:49.204
You are!

06:50.444 --> 06:51.564
But Yao doesn't think so.

06:51.564 --> 06:53.764
He thinks I'm useless.

06:54.004 --> 06:55.204
Yao?

06:55.474 --> 06:56.354
Yeah.

06:56.354 --> 06:57.844
He's a know-it-all.

06:58.084 --> 06:59.563
He's lightning. He's light.

06:59.564 --> 07:01.203
He's the only fairy tale.

07:01.204 --> 07:03.324
He'd take up everything on his shoulder.

07:04.564 --> 07:05.594
Don't be angry at him.

07:05.594 --> 07:07.284
I talked to him this morning.

07:08.154 --> 07:09.274
How is that possible?

07:09.274 --> 07:10.844
Granny, don't console me.

07:11.674 --> 07:13.153
I won't.

07:13.154 --> 07:14.883
Ignore him as you want.

07:14.884 --> 07:17.113
Just don't get angry.

07:17.114 --> 07:18.913
How could I?

07:18.914 --> 07:20.673
You see his duplicity!

07:20.674 --> 07:22.443
Now he's started it.

07:22.444 --> 07:24.234
What could I do to correct this?

07:24.884 --> 07:26.764
I'll help you.

07:27.964 --> 07:29.233
No way.

07:29.234 --> 07:30.843
You'd be on his side.

07:30.844 --> 07:32.033
I promise.

07:32.034 --> 07:33.964
I will give him a lesson on your behalf.

07:34.714 --> 07:35.843
For real?

07:35.844 --> 07:36.844
For real!

07:38.564 --> 07:39.564
Helping you

07:40.034 --> 07:41.554
and helping him are the same thing.

07:48.524 --> 07:49.524
Here.

07:49.644 --> 07:50.724
Try this.

07:54.474 --> 07:56.563
Granny, come on.

07:56.564 --> 07:58.324
You're so sweet.

08:12.564 --> 08:13.564
Xu Hongdou.

08:20.004 --> 08:21.004
Xu Hongdou.

09:08.164 --> 09:09.164
Xu...

09:25.844 --> 09:26.844
Mr. Hu?

09:26.994 --> 09:27.994
What's wrong?

09:29.964 --> 09:31.004
Xie.

09:32.234 --> 09:33.554
What happened?

09:35.444 --> 09:36.834
My mom said,

09:38.714 --> 09:39.884
my dad...

09:42.964 --> 09:44.194
What about him?

09:47.114 --> 09:49.164
He wanted me to come home
for New Year's Eve dinner.

09:50.114 --> 09:51.804
You scared me a lot.

09:51.804 --> 09:53.034
Come on, Xie.

09:53.684 --> 09:55.473
Come here. Stay with me.

09:55.474 --> 09:56.233
But...

09:56.234 --> 09:57.884
What about tomorrow?

09:58.084 --> 09:59.683
Now is the time.

09:59.684 --> 10:00.564
This is very important.

10:00.564 --> 10:01.843
We need to talk.

10:01.844 --> 10:03.164
Come on, sit down.

10:09.964 --> 10:10.964
Fine.

10:12.474 --> 10:13.484
Go ahead.

10:23.164 --> 10:24.314
I'm afraid

10:26.964 --> 10:28.364
I'm in love with her.

10:31.204 --> 10:32.394
Which one is it?

10:32.394 --> 10:33.563
There are many girls.

10:33.564 --> 10:35.074
I'm serious.

10:35.514 --> 10:37.284
I only care about Manjun.

10:39.444 --> 10:40.444
And?

10:44.964 --> 10:47.194
How should I tell
my parents about it?

10:47.394 --> 10:49.364
Why would I know?

10:50.084 --> 10:51.124
No, no.

10:52.964 --> 10:53.994
It's been a long time.

10:53.994 --> 10:56.284
Finally, I get to eat at home.

10:57.204 --> 10:58.394
If I told them about her,

10:58.394 --> 10:59.714
they would never agree to it.

10:59.714 --> 11:00.714
Right?

11:01.564 --> 11:02.714
My dad is in poor health.

11:02.714 --> 11:03.594
I'm afraid upon hearing it, he'd...

11:03.594 --> 11:04.884
Hold on a second.

11:07.084 --> 11:09.604
Has Manjun agreed
to your proposal?

11:10.394 --> 11:11.283
Not yet.

11:11.284 --> 11:12.114
What's your problem?

11:12.114 --> 11:12.804
Nothing is going on.

11:12.804 --> 11:13.514
Stop wasting my time.

11:13.514 --> 11:14.593
Hold on, Xie.

11:14.594 --> 11:14.804
Please.

11:14.804 --> 11:16.164
Listen to me.

11:16.634 --> 11:20.563
I want to plan in
advance just like you.

11:20.564 --> 11:21.233
Okay?

11:21.234 --> 11:22.554
I want to

11:22.844 --> 11:24.993
clear the way for love.

11:24.994 --> 11:26.993
Yeah, she's keeping a distance from me now.

11:26.994 --> 11:28.484
Go on clearing it if you like.

11:35.924 --> 11:38.244
We're both alike.

11:48.474 --> 11:49.564
The door is unlocked.

11:49.564 --> 11:50.764
Come in.

11:59.714 --> 12:01.284
How can I help you, President Xie?

12:17.874 --> 12:19.124
Letter of Apology.

12:19.994 --> 12:21.364
Dear Ms. Xu Hongdou.

12:21.564 --> 12:22.564
Hello.

12:23.044 --> 12:27.914
I am writing to sincerely apologize to you.

12:28.874 --> 12:29.874
I am sorry.

12:30.114 --> 12:33.513
After reflecting on
myself for the entire day,

12:33.514 --> 12:36.203
I have realized it all happened

12:36.204 --> 12:39.803
because of my
self-approbation, arrogance,

12:39.804 --> 12:41.004
and complacence.

12:41.564 --> 12:44.284
This creates a rift
in our relationship.

12:44.474 --> 12:46.843
If I don't correct
it, it will lead to

12:46.844 --> 12:48.834
a serious trust issue,

12:49.084 --> 12:52.604
which will threaten
our relationship for sure.

12:53.924 --> 12:54.993
As the saying goes,

12:54.994 --> 12:57.164
as you sow, so shall you reap.

12:57.444 --> 12:59.393
If I doubt you now,

12:59.394 --> 13:02.113
it might result in catastrophes.

13:02.114 --> 13:04.633
As a result, please allow me to

13:04.634 --> 13:07.484
apologize from the bottom of my heart.

13:07.994 --> 13:08.923
I'm sorry.

13:08.924 --> 13:09.924
I shouldn't have done it.

13:10.714 --> 13:12.513
If I have the honor to be forgiven,

13:12.514 --> 13:15.713
I promise my absolute loyalty to you.

13:15.714 --> 13:17.713
I will hide no secret from you,

13:17.714 --> 13:19.594
including my work, my life,

13:19.594 --> 13:21.563
and my mental activity.

13:21.564 --> 13:22.563
I request to

13:22.564 --> 13:24.353
build an equal, friendly relationship

13:24.354 --> 13:25.764
with mutual assistance.

13:26.634 --> 13:27.674
P.S.

13:28.394 --> 13:30.044
I will take full responsibility

13:30.044 --> 13:32.233
for all the emotional losses

13:32.234 --> 13:34.923
this concealment incident might have caused.

13:34.924 --> 13:36.794
Yours, Xie Zhiyao.

13:55.084 --> 13:56.474
I acknowledge your request.

13:56.474 --> 13:57.914
I will deal with it ASAP.

13:58.164 --> 13:59.194
Anything else?

13:59.564 --> 14:00.490
That's all.

14:00.514 --> 14:02.794
Have a pleasant night.

14:03.044 --> 14:04.044
Good night.

14:10.084 --> 14:11.233
Ms. Xu.

14:11.234 --> 14:13.434
Please deal with it
as soon as possible.

14:16.634 --> 14:17.764
Good night.

14:57.394 --> 14:58.394
What's up?

14:58.714 --> 15:00.164
Let's do something bad.

15:00.444 --> 15:01.714
Something bad?

15:03.754 --> 15:04.754
Let's go.

15:30.804 --> 15:31.514
This is it.

15:31.514 --> 15:32.554
Right here?

15:40.844 --> 15:42.283
What are you looking for?

15:42.284 --> 15:44.753
Video cameras.

15:44.754 --> 15:45.803
I've cased it.

15:45.804 --> 15:46.804
There's none.

15:48.234 --> 15:49.524
You're good at this.

15:51.804 --> 15:52.443
Come on.

15:52.444 --> 15:53.444
Here.

15:56.964 --> 15:58.283
Make it big.

15:58.284 --> 15:59.604
I want a large sign.

16:02.204 --> 16:03.353
I saw his face!

16:03.354 --> 16:05.194
He was furious.

16:05.594 --> 16:07.923
I'm sure he knows who painted on his door.

16:07.924 --> 16:09.563
So what?

16:09.564 --> 16:11.473
He wouldn't go after the suspect.

16:11.474 --> 16:13.394
Among so many
doors, why did his door

16:13.394 --> 16:15.074
become the target?

16:15.324 --> 16:16.994
After this incident,
everyone knows

16:16.994 --> 16:18.394
he's behind it.

16:18.394 --> 16:19.443
Exactly.

16:19.444 --> 16:22.994
The suspect went to
town to buy the paint.

16:22.994 --> 16:24.394
The camera there captured him.

16:24.394 --> 16:26.083
Still, he thinks himself clever.

16:26.084 --> 16:28.354
Everything happens for a reason.

16:28.354 --> 16:30.323
He deserves this punishment.

16:30.324 --> 16:32.004
Aunt Gui.

16:32.924 --> 16:34.914
I am working!

16:35.234 --> 16:35.964
Baoping.

16:35.964 --> 16:36.874
Am I working or not?

16:36.874 --> 16:38.203
Yes, you are!

16:38.204 --> 16:39.764
Working while talking.

16:58.194 --> 17:00.113
Ms. Xu Hongdou.

17:00.114 --> 17:02.044
What about my apology letter?

17:06.434 --> 17:07.644
Going to Beijing?

17:11.394 --> 17:12.884
Put it down. I'll help.

17:13.194 --> 17:13.764
It's okay.

17:13.764 --> 17:15.124
It's not heavy.

17:16.434 --> 17:17.434
Leave it to me.

17:18.484 --> 17:20.153
Why go back to Beijing suddenly?

17:20.154 --> 17:21.234
It's a long story.

17:21.564 --> 17:23.884
I haven't given up my place in Beijing.

17:24.394 --> 17:25.763
The water pipe leaks.

17:25.764 --> 17:26.674
The water flooded my neighbor downstairs.

17:26.674 --> 17:27.844
The landlord just called me

17:27.844 --> 17:29.113
and asked me to go back.

17:29.114 --> 17:30.483
He's there with plumbers.

17:30.484 --> 17:31.634
All my belongings are there.

17:31.634 --> 17:33.083
I must collect them.

17:33.084 --> 17:34.113
That's urgent.

17:34.114 --> 17:35.724
I'll go with you.

17:35.724 --> 17:36.284
Don't.

17:36.284 --> 17:38.754
We need you at the construction site.

17:39.484 --> 17:41.323
How about driving
me to the airport?

17:41.324 --> 17:42.324
Sure.

17:42.594 --> 17:42.844
Okay.

17:42.844 --> 17:43.804
The flight is at nine.

17:43.804 --> 17:45.044
Sure, let's go.

17:56.084 --> 17:57.274
Your phone.

17:59.114 --> 18:00.404
Let me answer it.

18:04.284 --> 18:05.514
Li Qing, what's up?

18:10.324 --> 18:12.644
Aren't you visiting the
college with Ms. Xie?

18:13.954 --> 18:15.234
Why are you crying?

18:16.724 --> 18:17.724
Calm down.

18:22.284 --> 18:23.004
Is Yue with you?

18:23.004 --> 18:24.274
Put her on the phone.

18:26.594 --> 18:28.164
What happened to Ms. Xie?

18:30.394 --> 18:31.394
What?

18:31.724 --> 18:32.994
Which hospital?

18:36.244 --> 18:36.914
Okay. Don't panic.

18:36.914 --> 18:37.844
I'm on my way.

18:37.844 --> 18:38.723
Wait for me.

18:38.724 --> 18:39.994
Yeah. Bye.

18:41.244 --> 18:42.804
Hongdou, I can't drive you to the airport.

18:43.084 --> 18:44.674
I need to get to the hospital.

18:44.874 --> 18:46.674
I'll get a cab to send
you to the airport.

18:47.724 --> 18:48.194
Wait.

18:48.194 --> 18:49.234
What happened?

18:53.724 --> 18:54.724
It's Ms. Xie.

18:54.724 --> 18:55.764
She's having a heart attack.

18:55.764 --> 18:57.084
She's in hospital now.

19:05.634 --> 19:06.644
Calm down.

19:10.194 --> 19:11.474
I'll cancel my flight.

19:11.844 --> 19:13.164
I'll go to the hospital with you.

19:19.194 --> 19:21.514
You cannot drive like this.

19:22.324 --> 19:22.874
Give me the key.

19:22.874 --> 19:23.874
I'll drive.

19:28.564 --> 19:29.564
Let's go.

19:55.324 --> 19:56.324
Yue.

19:56.844 --> 19:58.243
How's Ms. Xie?

19:58.244 --> 19:59.843
The doctor said she was out of danger.

19:59.844 --> 20:01.044
But she hasn't woken up.

20:01.914 --> 20:03.604
Why did she faint?

20:04.004 --> 20:04.354
The doctor says

20:04.354 --> 20:06.084
it's because of excessive fatigue.

20:12.674 --> 20:13.914
Relax. She'll make it.

20:35.354 --> 20:36.083
President Xie.

20:36.084 --> 20:37.113
Hongdou.

20:37.114 --> 20:38.114
The restaurants are closed.

20:38.114 --> 20:40.353
I get you some soy
milk and stuffed buns.

20:40.354 --> 20:40.914
Thanks.

20:40.914 --> 20:41.873
Thank you.

20:41.874 --> 20:43.324
Anything will do.

20:43.564 --> 20:44.804
I'm getting in.

20:49.394 --> 20:50.404
Thank you.

20:59.394 --> 21:01.164
What about your place in Beijing?

21:01.764 --> 21:02.873
Leave it be.

21:02.874 --> 21:03.994
The landlord is there.

21:04.564 --> 21:06.044
My belongings are soaked already.

21:06.324 --> 21:07.914
She's more important than my property.

21:09.594 --> 21:11.124
Thankfully, I've got you.

21:11.874 --> 21:13.364
When I got the call,

21:13.954 --> 21:15.324
I panicked.

21:17.004 --> 21:19.083
That's why we need a partner.

21:19.084 --> 21:20.674
You stand in front, guarding me.

21:20.954 --> 21:22.194
I've got your back.

21:22.194 --> 21:23.604
You can take a break.

21:24.914 --> 21:25.874
Would you please

21:25.874 --> 21:27.604
share with me some of your burdens?

21:28.084 --> 21:29.404
Have faith in me.

21:34.114 --> 21:35.114
I hear you.

21:36.564 --> 21:38.404
Your apology letter is approved.

21:40.244 --> 21:41.404
Thank you.

21:42.284 --> 21:43.514
No problem.

22:09.564 --> 22:11.673
Harley Davidson, Sportster.

22:11.674 --> 22:12.994
X48.

22:14.044 --> 22:15.404
A nice motorcycle.

22:15.764 --> 22:17.164
But the fuel range is bad.

22:18.954 --> 22:20.514
Thank you for the lift.

22:21.114 --> 22:22.804
It was fun tonight.

22:23.284 --> 22:24.913
Take care.

22:24.914 --> 22:25.994
Goodbye.

22:30.084 --> 22:31.003
Yu?

22:31.004 --> 22:32.324
You're still up.

22:33.634 --> 22:34.754
I left the door open for you.

22:38.674 --> 22:39.674
Take your seat.

22:41.674 --> 22:42.954
Where did you go?

22:43.484 --> 22:44.674
I went camping.

22:45.564 --> 22:46.954
Who was it on the motor?

22:47.674 --> 22:49.274
A boy I met at the camp.

22:56.594 --> 22:57.594
What's wrong?

22:58.354 --> 22:59.354
Nothing.

23:02.844 --> 23:03.844
No, it's not.

23:06.154 --> 23:07.604
I need to tell you something.

23:08.564 --> 23:10.003
Is it about your family?

23:10.004 --> 23:11.084
It's about me.

23:13.004 --> 23:14.004
Go ahead.

23:19.954 --> 23:21.804
I lied to you.

23:24.284 --> 23:25.474
Actually,

23:26.044 --> 23:27.364
I'm not gifted.

23:29.044 --> 23:30.364
No way!

23:32.724 --> 23:34.844
I love Wind, that song you wrote.

23:35.724 --> 23:37.393
If it wasn't for the song,

23:37.394 --> 23:38.994
I wouldn't be here at all.

23:45.284 --> 23:49.404
I didn't write that song.

23:53.634 --> 23:54.644
Well.

23:56.044 --> 23:57.604
I wrote the lyrics.

23:58.564 --> 23:59.754
But the music

24:00.354 --> 24:01.714
was from a friend.

24:02.954 --> 24:04.714
The original music

24:05.244 --> 24:06.714
was in poor taste.

24:09.434 --> 24:10.644
Maybe,

24:11.324 --> 24:13.124
at best, I can only make

24:13.324 --> 24:18.954
catchy songs like
Oh, Lonely Men.

24:19.954 --> 24:21.884
The kind of talent appeals to you?

24:25.954 --> 24:27.514
I don't have it.

24:33.874 --> 24:35.193
I know it.

24:35.194 --> 24:36.564
I'm not smart enough

24:37.724 --> 24:39.274
to fool you around.

24:39.874 --> 24:41.674
You'll find it out soon.

24:43.434 --> 24:44.564
Or maybe,

24:45.394 --> 24:47.274
you know it already.

24:48.434 --> 24:50.084
Instead of being exposed,

24:50.434 --> 24:52.674
I'd rather confess it myself.

24:53.914 --> 24:55.324
For your reference

24:55.914 --> 24:59.324
as you measure.

25:01.954 --> 25:03.674
Measure what?

25:10.004 --> 25:11.404
Don't you have a reference

25:12.394 --> 25:14.514
to measure your potential partners?

25:15.484 --> 25:18.044
For example, his talent,

25:19.044 --> 25:20.044
income,

25:21.044 --> 25:24.884
age, personality, and
other requirements.

25:25.634 --> 25:26.634
Right?

25:27.084 --> 25:28.084
Am I...

25:29.874 --> 25:34.914
under your consideration?

25:50.194 --> 25:51.714
In my mind,

25:52.324 --> 25:53.714
you're my goddess.

25:57.564 --> 25:58.564
I mean it.

25:59.804 --> 26:00.954
You're a goddess

26:01.594 --> 26:02.914
holding the torch high,

26:03.154 --> 26:06.043
showing me the
way, telling me that

26:06.044 --> 26:08.433
you need self-respect,
self-esteem,

26:08.434 --> 26:09.563
don't look down upon yourself,

26:09.564 --> 26:11.474
don't be arrogant.

26:12.354 --> 26:14.714
From now on, I
believe in no one else

26:18.354 --> 26:19.434
but you.

26:23.954 --> 26:24.954
It's just...

26:26.954 --> 26:28.474
I'm afraid you don't like me.

26:42.194 --> 26:44.194
What's your opinion?

26:49.244 --> 26:50.914
Yu, to be honest,

26:52.594 --> 26:56.514
I think you are talented.

26:57.844 --> 26:59.843
Otherwise, you would have given it up already.

26:59.844 --> 27:01.364
I see your enthusiasm.

27:03.594 --> 27:04.604
Well,

27:05.114 --> 27:09.234
maybe you're not what
we define as a prodigy.

27:10.114 --> 27:12.674
Still, you are talented
to a certain extent.

27:21.084 --> 27:23.364
I'm no goddess.

27:24.844 --> 27:27.044
If anything, I am
older than you are.

27:28.874 --> 27:30.803
I've witnessed more.

27:30.804 --> 27:32.404
I'm more experienced. That's all.

27:34.004 --> 27:36.404
There's something I
want to tell you tomorrow.

27:38.564 --> 27:39.714
But now we're talking.

27:40.004 --> 27:42.644
I'll tell you today.

27:46.084 --> 27:47.714
I'm going back to Beijing the day after.

27:50.804 --> 27:51.914
Why?

27:52.434 --> 27:54.914
I find a job as an organizer.

27:55.194 --> 27:55.564
Look at me.

27:55.564 --> 27:57.393
I've been a housewife for years.

27:57.394 --> 27:59.003
I'm good at this.

27:59.004 --> 28:00.714
This job suits me perfectly.

28:00.914 --> 28:03.604
And the company wants
to register there soon.

28:04.154 --> 28:05.564
What about me?

28:07.804 --> 28:11.124
We can text each other.

28:11.874 --> 28:13.644
Can we still meet?

28:15.354 --> 28:17.193
If you come to Beijing, call me.

28:17.194 --> 28:18.324
I'll treat you to a meal.

28:29.874 --> 28:30.954
Yu.

28:33.194 --> 28:35.644
I really enjoy my days here.

28:38.044 --> 28:40.404
When I'm away, keep
up with your music career.

28:41.324 --> 28:42.674
Wherever I am,

28:43.434 --> 28:45.124
I will cheer for you.

28:45.874 --> 28:47.324
I've always got your back.

28:49.586 --> 28:51.736
♫ I always long ♫

28:51.737 --> 28:53.770
♫ for my goal ♫

28:54.864 --> 28:56.917
♫ But the harder I seek it ♫

28:57.224 --> 29:00.077
♫ the clumsier I become ♫

29:00.594 --> 29:01.994
Time to sleep.

29:02.577 --> 29:04.904
♫ My panic ♫

29:05.586 --> 29:08.564
♫ It is witnessing ♫

29:10.758 --> 29:13.185
♫ But it never speaks ♫

29:13.186 --> 29:14.577
♫ Some people stop ♫

29:14.578 --> 29:17.470
♫ Some carry on ♫

29:18.771 --> 29:20.097
♫ Wandering ♫

29:20.815 --> 29:25.792
♫ Our life is like a house
while the days are like windows ♫

29:26.044 --> 29:31.044
♫ capturing fragmented stories
in our daily life ♫

29:31.044 --> 29:33.364
♫ Oh, each window ♫

29:38.986 --> 29:40.592
♫ People ♫

29:51.929 --> 29:54.564
♫ are always so forgetful ♫

29:56.284 --> 29:57.674
Ms. Xie.

29:59.564 --> 30:00.564
Auntie.

30:00.954 --> 30:02.194
You're awake.

30:02.724 --> 30:04.044
How do you feel?

30:07.084 --> 30:08.324
Yao.

30:16.594 --> 30:17.594
I'm here.

30:22.194 --> 30:24.084
When I'm gone,

30:25.354 --> 30:27.164
don't be sad.

30:30.394 --> 30:36.164
I live my life for myself.

30:38.804 --> 30:41.194
I have a full life

30:44.194 --> 30:46.714
with no regret.

30:51.634 --> 30:52.714
Auntie.

30:54.354 --> 30:55.884
You will be fine.

31:04.194 --> 31:05.194
Auntie.

31:06.004 --> 31:07.004
Auntie!

31:21.394 --> 31:23.084
I thought you were at the construction site.

31:23.434 --> 31:26.194
I'm here to check on Ms. Xie.

31:28.354 --> 31:29.324
Auntie.

31:29.324 --> 31:29.874
I told you.

31:29.874 --> 31:30.914
You need rest.

31:30.914 --> 31:32.564
Yet here you are, at the embroidery workshop.

31:33.044 --> 31:35.043
Please take good care of yourself.

31:35.044 --> 31:36.044
You can only make more embroideries

31:36.044 --> 31:37.563
if you are in a good health.

31:37.564 --> 31:39.954
You'd lose it
all if you are ill.

31:40.634 --> 31:42.604
I can't always stay in bed.

31:43.044 --> 31:44.474
I've recovered.

31:44.914 --> 31:48.043
I just want to take a
look and stay in the sun.

31:48.044 --> 31:49.404
It's good for my health.

31:49.724 --> 31:50.564
Li Qing is so strict.

31:50.564 --> 31:52.044
She even forbids me to pick up the needles.

31:53.844 --> 31:55.234
What did you make?

31:56.194 --> 31:57.324
Fish soup.

31:57.564 --> 31:58.434
I leave some for you at home.

31:58.434 --> 31:59.564
We can eat together.

32:00.354 --> 32:01.633
Let's share it.

32:01.634 --> 32:03.084
It's too much for me.

32:03.634 --> 32:04.564
Not at all.

32:04.564 --> 32:05.884
Take your time.

32:06.284 --> 32:07.283
For breakfast,

32:07.284 --> 32:09.673
you always have buns and porridge.

32:09.674 --> 32:11.083
You need nourishment.

32:11.084 --> 32:13.564
If I had known it, I'd
have asked Li Qing

32:13.564 --> 32:14.714
to take care of you earlier.

32:15.484 --> 32:17.484
That day in the hospital,
when you woke up,

32:17.484 --> 32:20.803
you held my hand and
said Yao, if I'm gone,

32:20.804 --> 32:22.044
don't be sad.

32:22.697 --> 32:24.144
You scared the hell out of me.

32:24.564 --> 32:26.324
My mind wasn't clear.

32:28.484 --> 32:30.084
That was my first time

32:30.084 --> 32:31.884
to know someone who has no regrets.

32:32.434 --> 32:33.754
Is that for real?

32:36.354 --> 32:37.754
Just one thing.

32:39.284 --> 32:40.284
What's that?

32:42.594 --> 32:44.324
When I was young,

32:44.844 --> 32:46.514
I used to be passionate.

32:47.954 --> 32:50.604
Edward wrote me a letter,

32:51.194 --> 32:52.843
saying that he was getting married

32:52.844 --> 32:54.474
and he wished me happiness.

32:54.764 --> 32:56.124
I didn't reply.

32:58.004 --> 32:59.124
Edward?

33:00.354 --> 33:02.954
Her ex-boyfriend,
the French painter.

33:05.324 --> 33:07.644
I wish I had replied to him and told him

33:07.954 --> 33:09.604
that I wish him happiness, too.

33:13.564 --> 33:14.873
Auntie Huailan.

33:14.874 --> 33:17.714
I found you love struck.

33:18.874 --> 33:20.873
I love that story!

33:20.874 --> 33:22.804
What are you talking about?

33:23.564 --> 33:25.243
What does love-struck mean?

33:25.244 --> 33:27.114
It means when you fall in love,

33:27.114 --> 33:29.474
you'd lose your mind
and stuck in it helplessly.

33:31.004 --> 33:32.483
Aren't you the same?

33:32.484 --> 33:33.763
Of course, I am!

33:33.764 --> 33:35.514
I am typically love-struck.

33:38.804 --> 33:39.804
Let's eat.

33:49.472 --> 33:52.004
♫ Do you ever feel alone? ♫

33:52.004 --> 33:53.004
Damai.

33:53.154 --> 33:54.244
What's in your luggage?

33:54.244 --> 33:55.244
It's so heavy.

33:55.594 --> 33:57.634
President Xu sent
me a whole ham.

33:57.634 --> 33:59.563
And Nana sent me some cheese.

33:59.564 --> 34:00.193
Cuo Bazi.

34:00.194 --> 34:00.674
There you go.

34:00.674 --> 34:02.163
Why stuff them in the luggage?

34:02.164 --> 34:03.794
They could send a delivery.

34:04.554 --> 34:05.324
Good to go.

34:05.324 --> 34:06.844
The pet logistics vehicle
is at the parking lot.

34:06.844 --> 34:07.643
Okay.

34:07.644 --> 34:08.433
Nana.

34:08.434 --> 34:10.354
Don't forget about the tasks tomorrow.

34:10.724 --> 34:11.684
When the boards arrive,

34:11.684 --> 34:13.164
check the product number and the color.

34:13.164 --> 34:14.433
Double-check before they are discharged.

34:14.434 --> 34:14.954
What else?

34:14.954 --> 34:15.724
Check the number.

34:15.724 --> 34:16.803
Take videos.

34:16.804 --> 34:17.603
Right!

34:17.604 --> 34:19.124
If anything goes
wrong, just call...

34:19.124 --> 34:20.714
Call Xiaochun.

34:21.324 --> 34:23.284
You'll only stay in Beijing for a few days.

34:23.284 --> 34:24.433
Have faith in me.

34:24.434 --> 34:25.033
I can handle it.

34:25.034 --> 34:25.554
Okay.

34:25.554 --> 34:26.554
We're leaving.

34:26.874 --> 34:27.683
I got this.

34:27.684 --> 34:27.874
Let me take it.

34:27.874 --> 34:28.683
Steady.

34:28.684 --> 34:29.324
Leave it to me. Go ahead.

34:29.324 --> 34:29.644
Are you okay?

34:29.644 --> 34:30.473
Yeah. Sure.

34:30.474 --> 34:31.033
Just go.

34:31.034 --> 34:32.084
Come on.

34:36.386 --> 34:40.392
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

34:46.644 --> 34:50.906
♫ It's just another day ♫

35:02.434 --> 35:04.874
I really miss the busy streets.

35:07.954 --> 35:09.993
I've only been away for a while.

35:09.994 --> 35:11.524
But this time,

35:12.164 --> 35:13.874
Beijing looks so bright to me.

35:15.644 --> 35:16.964
It's lively,

35:17.554 --> 35:18.564
solemn,

35:19.844 --> 35:20.844
and beautiful.

35:21.914 --> 35:24.044
Are you here on a business trip?

35:24.994 --> 35:26.123
Honeymoon.

35:26.124 --> 35:27.164
Newly-married?

35:27.434 --> 35:29.243
I can tell you two
are a perfect match.

35:29.244 --> 35:30.163
Happy wedding!

35:30.164 --> 35:31.314
Thank you.

35:31.994 --> 35:33.444
Any plans for sightseeing?

35:34.074 --> 35:35.163
Not yet.

35:35.164 --> 35:36.394
Any suggestion?

35:36.804 --> 35:37.844
As the capital city,

35:37.844 --> 35:38.994
Beijing is full of fun places.

35:38.994 --> 35:40.683
It's widely known.

35:40.684 --> 35:41.874
There are the Imperial Palace,

35:42.954 --> 35:43.954
the Bird's Nest Stadium,

35:44.204 --> 35:46.124
and Sanlitun.

35:46.554 --> 35:47.284
In the morning,

35:47.284 --> 35:48.394
you could go to Tian'anmen Square

35:48.394 --> 35:49.433
to watch the flag-raising ceremony.

35:49.434 --> 35:51.034
In the afternoon, you
could visit Badaling.

35:51.034 --> 35:51.994
Then, you can spend the night

35:51.994 --> 35:53.473
with your wife at Nanluoguxiang.

35:53.474 --> 35:54.434
There are so many places to go.

35:54.434 --> 35:56.243
It all depends on you.

35:56.244 --> 35:56.953
Great.

35:56.954 --> 35:58.874
We'll look them up.

36:00.284 --> 36:02.034
By the way, the hotel you choose

36:02.034 --> 36:03.284
lies by the subway entrance.

36:03.284 --> 36:04.604
It's very convenient.

36:15.284 --> 36:16.284
Hongdou.

36:17.724 --> 36:18.924
We've arrived at the hotel.

36:24.074 --> 36:26.964
I've never seen the hotel
from this perspective.

36:27.684 --> 36:29.084
I worked there for so long.

36:29.604 --> 36:31.044
I never knew what it looks like.

36:32.724 --> 36:34.674
I passed it by several times.

36:35.124 --> 36:36.874
But I never got in.

36:44.015 --> 36:48.421
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

36:54.437 --> 36:59.164
♫ It's just another day ♫

37:03.164 --> 37:04.203
Stop staring.

37:04.204 --> 37:05.204
Let's go.

37:17.124 --> 37:18.123
We're here to check in.

37:18.124 --> 37:19.194
Good evening.

37:19.394 --> 37:20.763
Manager Xu!

37:20.764 --> 37:21.874
Manager Xu!

37:21.874 --> 37:22.684
It's been a long time!

37:22.684 --> 37:23.843
How are you doing?

37:23.844 --> 37:24.644
We?

37:24.644 --> 37:25.843
As usual.

37:25.844 --> 37:26.244
And you?

37:26.244 --> 37:27.964
Which hotel do you work in?

37:28.204 --> 37:29.354
I don't work in hotels.

37:29.354 --> 37:31.604
I'm running a guesthouse in Yunnan.

37:31.844 --> 37:33.353
That's like a dream!

37:33.354 --> 37:34.764
No wonder you resigned.

37:34.764 --> 37:35.604
You look different!

37:35.604 --> 37:36.474
So spirited now!

37:36.474 --> 37:37.564
Really?

37:38.764 --> 37:40.553
Are you two together?

37:40.554 --> 37:40.994
Yes.

37:40.994 --> 37:42.124
This is my boyfriend.

37:42.844 --> 37:43.803
Hello.

37:43.804 --> 37:44.553
Hi.

37:44.554 --> 37:46.323
I booked a room.

37:46.324 --> 37:47.033
Xie Zhiyao.

37:47.034 --> 37:47.554
Okay.

37:47.554 --> 37:49.314
Manager Xu's boyfriend!

37:49.874 --> 37:50.914
I'll check you in now.

37:50.914 --> 37:52.234
I hope you enjoy your stay.

38:00.844 --> 38:02.714
The room looks nice.

38:13.804 --> 38:15.244
Come on, get up.

38:15.244 --> 38:16.204
Your clothes must be dirty.

38:16.204 --> 38:17.324
Take a shower and
change your clothes.

38:17.324 --> 38:18.300
Come on.

38:18.324 --> 38:19.683
I'll get them washed.

38:19.684 --> 38:20.804
We can wash them at my place.

38:20.804 --> 38:22.524
The laundry here is expensive.

38:23.034 --> 38:24.553
Don't be stingy.

38:24.554 --> 38:25.954
Your place was flooded.

38:25.954 --> 38:26.684
You can't live there.

38:26.684 --> 38:28.084
Forget about it.

38:28.394 --> 38:29.553
Go take a shower.

38:29.554 --> 38:30.034
Come on.

38:30.034 --> 38:30.644
Fine.

38:30.644 --> 38:31.754
I hear you.

38:33.034 --> 38:34.274
Take a shower.

38:48.994 --> 38:50.124
I'm done.

38:50.844 --> 38:52.124
Have you dried your hair?

38:53.954 --> 38:54.843
Come over.

38:54.844 --> 38:55.964
Let me check.

39:01.244 --> 39:02.643
No.

39:02.644 --> 39:04.393
You didn't blow dry it.

39:04.394 --> 39:05.394
Come on.

39:05.474 --> 39:06.524
I'll help you.

39:11.354 --> 39:12.553
Aren't you tired?

39:12.554 --> 39:13.554
I am.

39:13.724 --> 39:14.874
But you'd catch a cold

39:14.874 --> 39:16.314
if you don't get them dry.

39:35.384 --> 39:41.878
♫ I've been alone in the unknown ♫

39:43.124 --> 39:44.123
Xu Hongdou.

39:44.124 --> 39:45.124
Tomorrow...

39:49.615 --> 39:56.364
♫ I'm searching for a meadow of mine ♫

39:56.872 --> 40:03.271
♫ Till you came in with the breeze ♫

40:03.272 --> 40:06.096
♫ A feeling rushes over me ♫

40:06.097 --> 40:10.814
♫ spills my heart into the field ♫

40:10.815 --> 40:17.456
♫ I know it I will be yours ♫

40:17.457 --> 40:24.935
♫ Would you ask for any horse ♫

40:28.354 --> 40:29.354
Good night.

40:53.354 --> 40:54.874
What time is it?

40:56.874 --> 40:58.314
11 a.m.

41:00.874 --> 41:02.044
Not in a hurry.

41:02.264 --> 41:07.977
♫ any horse but this one inside your heart ♫

41:08.264 --> 41:15.191
♫ I'll give you the saddle of my heart ♫

41:15.994 --> 41:17.194
Come in, please.

41:21.474 --> 41:23.073
It looks all right.

41:23.074 --> 41:24.603
I thought it would be worse.

41:24.604 --> 41:26.234
The landlord has cleaned it.

41:26.874 --> 41:28.474
I was worried about my clothes,

41:28.474 --> 41:30.034
books, and appliances.

41:30.034 --> 41:31.034
Well.

41:31.394 --> 41:32.394
We could put some of them on the resale market.

41:32.394 --> 41:33.874
Throw the scarps away.

41:34.164 --> 41:35.234
Let's start.

41:35.554 --> 41:36.763
Do you have duct tape?

41:36.764 --> 41:37.764
Yeah.

41:46.874 --> 41:48.674
Thankfully, I'm here with you.

41:48.954 --> 41:51.354
Packing them up would
take you a long time.

41:51.604 --> 41:52.754
Besides,

41:53.354 --> 41:56.044
I'd be worried if you
come here on your own.

41:56.644 --> 41:58.164
Why is that?

41:58.764 --> 42:00.643
You arrived in Beijing alone.

42:00.644 --> 42:02.524
Now you're leaving this city.

42:02.994 --> 42:04.874
On your own? It's would sad.

42:05.354 --> 42:07.164
You're overthinking.

42:07.394 --> 42:09.444
I feel different after
landing in Beijing.

42:10.434 --> 42:11.674
What do you mean?

42:13.394 --> 42:15.394
I'm in a different state of mind.

42:15.994 --> 42:17.993
I don't ask for anything here.

42:17.994 --> 42:19.604
It's a relief.

42:19.914 --> 42:22.484
I feel there are more
possibilities here.

42:29.284 --> 42:31.953
When your business grows big enough,

42:31.954 --> 42:33.033
you could run a guesthouse

42:33.034 --> 42:35.274
in the suburbs here, close to the Great Wall.

42:35.914 --> 42:37.994
I visited the villages there.

42:37.994 --> 42:39.473
They are pristine.

42:39.474 --> 42:40.873
The villagers still burn firewood

42:40.874 --> 42:42.794
and build their houses using stones nearby.

42:43.434 --> 42:44.124
Think about it.

42:44.124 --> 42:46.434
During the weekend,
drive for two to three hours

42:46.434 --> 42:48.803
away from the big city.

42:48.804 --> 42:50.754
Feel the fresh air

42:51.164 --> 42:52.953
and experience traditional life.

42:52.954 --> 42:54.794
That applied to your business philosophy.

42:55.074 --> 42:56.163
That's great.

42:56.164 --> 42:56.913
You know it.

42:56.914 --> 42:58.074
In the north,

42:58.074 --> 42:59.353
the four seasons are distinct from each other.

42:59.354 --> 43:01.353
The scenery varies in different seasons.

43:01.354 --> 43:02.124
Think about it.

43:02.124 --> 43:05.473
When it snows in winter,
light up the fireplace,

43:05.474 --> 43:06.993
watching the snow outside.

43:06.994 --> 43:08.124
It's beautiful.

43:08.394 --> 43:09.874
It would be lovely.

43:11.164 --> 43:12.484
I'm telling you.

43:12.954 --> 43:14.993
You must be prepared.

43:14.994 --> 43:17.123
If my guesthouse grows bigger and stronger,

43:17.124 --> 43:18.924
I'd run branches in different places.

43:22.164 --> 43:23.924
Don't give me that look.

43:24.434 --> 43:25.674
Do you disagree?

43:27.434 --> 43:29.444
I hold a secret from you.

43:31.954 --> 43:33.484
What is it this time?

43:35.434 --> 43:36.874
Actually,

43:38.764 --> 43:41.803
Granny saves money
for my betrothal gifts.

43:41.804 --> 43:44.274
I could use them
to buy flight tickets.

43:46.074 --> 43:47.354
You scared me!

43:48.074 --> 43:49.444
I'm serious.

43:49.644 --> 43:51.393
When you talked about coming back to Beijing,

43:51.394 --> 43:54.274
I was thinking about
flying here every week.

43:56.204 --> 43:57.643
You are all talking.

43:57.644 --> 43:58.794
You're so busy.

43:59.244 --> 44:00.354
I'll squeeze you in.

44:00.604 --> 44:01.953
To get what I want,

44:01.954 --> 44:03.723
I have to put in the time, energy,

44:03.724 --> 44:05.604
and efforts to travel.

44:06.554 --> 44:07.804
Sounds like pie in the sky.

44:07.804 --> 44:09.084
I dare not catch it.

44:10.554 --> 44:11.554
That's right.

44:15.994 --> 44:17.124
Wait for me.

44:42.958 --> 44:46.649
♫ Keeps staring at my phone ♫

44:48.324 --> 44:49.674
Excuse me, sir.

44:49.874 --> 44:52.924
I'm Xu Hongdou, the
front desk manager.

44:53.244 --> 44:54.764
How may I help you?

44:54.764 --> 44:58.049
♫ I'd say I had a good chance ♫

44:59.815 --> 45:02.394
♫ To open up your heart ♫

45:02.394 --> 45:04.924
Is this the uniform you used to wear?

45:05.354 --> 45:06.524
So? How is it?

45:11.804 --> 45:12.804
Beautiful.

45:14.034 --> 45:15.604
Come closer. Let me see it.

45:21.754 --> 45:25.443
♫ It's so loud ♫

45:25.444 --> 45:29.621
♫ Beating of my heart for you ♫

45:31.329 --> 45:33.706
♫ Off the ground ♫

45:37.554 --> 45:38.924
Sir.

45:39.554 --> 45:41.084
This is inappropriate.

46:00.415 --> 46:04.583
♫ You need to validate ♫

46:04.584 --> 46:09.049
♫ Validate my love for you ♫

46:10.129 --> 46:14.083
♫ It's so loud ♫

46:14.084 --> 46:18.392
♫ Beating of my heart for you ♫

46:19.786 --> 46:22.785
♫ Off the ground ♫

46:22.786 --> 46:28.078
♫ You lift me so high my love ♫

46:29.272 --> 46:32.163
♫ Hardly breathing ♫

46:32.164 --> 46:38.049
♫ Validation feels so near ♫

46:38.874 --> 46:44.384
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

46:46.314 --> 46:51.304
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

46:53.724 --> 46:59.814
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

47:00.094 --> 47:05.514
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

47:08.434 --> 47:13.864
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

47:15.804 --> 47:20.704
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

47:23.234 --> 47:29.474
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

47:29.764 --> 47:35.994
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

47:38.044 --> 47:44.483
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

47:44.484 --> 47:51.274
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

47:52.614 --> 47:54.663
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

47:54.664 --> 47:59.094
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

47:59.294 --> 48:06.564
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

